Subject: [PATCH 05/11] qbe: add an embeddable stream entry point

Add a serial, non-reentrant stream compilation API and isolate QBE global symbols so the backend can be linked into a larger compiler. Preserve the command-line entry point under an isolated name and report parser errors to the caller.

---
diff --git a/all.h b/all.h
--- a/all.h
+++ b/all.h
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@
 #include <stdio.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
 #include <string.h>
+#include "namespace.h"
 
 #define MAKESURE(what, x) typedef char make_sure_##what[(x)?1:-1]
 #define die(...) die_(__FILE__, __VA_ARGS__)
diff --git a/config.h b/config.h
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/config.h
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
